<body><div class="app" id="app">
<div class="topbar"><div class="container"><span>✦ YOUR TANZANIA ADVENTURE STARTS HERE</span><div class="toplinks"><a href="#contact" data-page="contact">Contact us</a><a href="#operators" data-page="operators">For tour operators</a><span>EN ▾</span></div></div></div>
<header class="navbar"><div class="container navinner"><a class="brand" href="#home" data-page="home"><span class="brandmark">✦</span><span>TANZANIA FAMTOUR<small>EXPLORE • EXPERIENCE • CONNECT</small></span></a><nav class="navlinks" id="navlinks"><a href="#home" data-page="home">Home</a><a href="#safaris" data-page="safaris">Safaris</a><a href="#destinations" data-page="destinations">Destinations</a><a href="#operators" data-page="operators">Tour Operators</a><a href="#about" data-page="about">About Us</a></nav><div class="navactions"><button class="iconbtn" title="Saved tours" onclick="showSaved()">♡</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="go('request')">Plan Your Trip ↗</button><button class="iconbtn menu-toggle" onclick="document.getElementById('navlinks').classList.toggle('open')">☰</button></div></div></header>
<main>
<section class="page active" id="page-home">
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-content"><div class="eyebrow">THE HEART OF AFRICA</div><h1>Discover Tanzania.<br><em>Experience Africa.</em></h1><p>From the endless Serengeti plains to the turquoise shores of Zanzibar, discover extraordinary journeys with local experts who know Tanzania best.</p><div class="hero-actions"><button class="btn btn-gold" onclick="go('safaris')">Explore Safaris&nbsp; →</button><button class="btn btn-white" onclick="go('request')">Plan a Custom Trip</button></div></div></section>
<div class="container search-wrap"><form class="searchbox" id="homeSearch"><div class="field"><label>Where do you want to go?</label><select id="homeDestination"><option value="">All Tanzania</option><option>Serengeti</option><option>Ngorongoro</option><option>Tarangire</option><option>Kilimanjaro</option><option>Zanzibar</option><option>Grumeti</option><option>Ruaha</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Travel date</label><input type="date" id="homeDate"></div><div class="field"><label>Travellers</label><select id="homeTravellers"><option>2 Travellers</option><option>1 Traveller</option><option>3 Travellers</option><option>4 Travellers</option><option>5+ Travellers</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Trip style</label><select id="homeStyle"><option value="">Any style</option><option>Luxury</option><option>Mid-range</option><option>Budget</option><option>Private</option></select></div><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">⌕ Find Safaris</button></form></div>
<section class="section container" id="destinationsHome"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">EXPLORE THE LAND</div><h2>Iconic destinations</h2><p class="section-sub">Every corner of Tanzania tells a different story. Find the landscape that calls to you.</p></div><a class="textlink" href="#destinations" data-page="destinations">VIEW ALL DESTINATIONS →</a></div><div class="dest-grid">
